        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Plain Ana &lt;b&gt;&amp;amp;&quot;&#39;</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 20px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2937;\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;color:#111827;\">Heading for Ana &lt;b&gt;&amp;amp;&quot;&#39;</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Hi Ana &lt;b&gt;&amp;amp;&quot;&#39;,</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">A paragraph with <strong>bold</strong>, a <a href=\"https://app.example.com/a?b=1&amp;c=&lt;2&gt;\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;text-decoration:underline;\">text link</a> and a bare link <a href=\"https://example.com/path\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;text-decoration:underline;\">example.com/path</a>. Second line joins the first.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;\">Used today</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:bold;margin:2px 0 6px 0;\">42 of 50</td></tr><tr><td><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f3f4f6;border-radius:4px;\"><tr><td width=\"84%\" style=\"background:#EA580C;height:8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td><td style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://app.example.com/a?b=1&amp;c=&lt;2&gt;\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;text-decoration:underline;\">Press here</a></strong></p><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding-left:22px;\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">first item with <a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;text-decoration:underline;\">a link</a></li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">second item 3</li></ul><ol style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding-left:22px;\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">step one</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">step two</li></ol><pre style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f3f4f6;border-radius:6px;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;\">curl -d &#39;{&quot;to&quot;: &quot;+15555550123&quot;}&#39; &lt;url&gt; &amp; more</pre><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Optional: yes &amp; no.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Signed<br>Name</p><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin-top:24px;padding-top:12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Footer text. <a href=\"https://api.example.com/u?t=x.y\" style=\"color:#1d4ed8;text-decoration:underline;\">unsubscribe</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">© 2026 example</p></div></div></body></html>",
        "text": "Heading for Ana <b>&amp;\"'\n\nHi Ana <b>&amp;\"',\n\nA paragraph with bold, a text link (https://app.example.com/a?b=1&c=<2>) and a bare link https://example.com/path. Second line joins the first.\n\nUsed today: 42 of 50\n\nPress here: https://app.example.com/a?b=1&c=<2>\n\n- first item with a link (https://example.com)\n- second item 3\n\n1. step one\n2. step two\n\ncurl -d '{\"to\": \"+15555550123\"}' <url> & more\n\nOptional: yes & no.\n\nSigned\nName\n\nFooter text. unsubscribe (https://api.example.com/u?t=x.y)\n\n© 2026 example\n"
      }
    }
  ],
